or 30年, not さんじゅうねん. If a number word has above-level kanji, preserve it with furigana. Do not confuse rank (えらい人) with height (高い人), or the date someone died with when they saw a ghost.\nThen write one question at the same level, with three short options and one correct answer.\nReturn only JSON: {\"sentences\":[\"...\"],\"question\":{\"prompt\":\"...\",\"options\":[\"...\",\"...\",\"...\"],\"answer\":0}}"
